WEBVTT

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:04.770
<i>Wealth, fame, power...</i>

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.670
<i>Gold Roger,
the King of the Pirates,</i>

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:08.970
<i>attained everything
this world has to offer.</i>

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:12.840
<i>The words he uttered just before
his death drove people to the seas.</i>

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:16.680
<i>My treasure? If you want it,
you can have it!</i>

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>Find it! I left everything
this world has to offer there!</i>

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:27.590
<i>And so men head for the Grand Line
in pursuit of their dreams!</i>

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:31.490
<i>The world has truly entered
a Great Pirate Era!</i>

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:36.860
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:42.770
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:44.100
<i>ONE PIECE!</i>

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:54.620
<i>Compasses only cause delays</i>

00:00:54.620 --> 00:01:00.350
<i>Delirious with fever,
I take the helm</i>

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:10.350
<i>If the dusty treasure map has
been verified, it's not a legend!</i>

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:18.170
<i>When it comes to personal storms,</i>

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:23.480
<i>simply ride aboard
someone else's biorhythm</i>

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:27.150
<i>and pretend it isn't there!</i>

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:32.650
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:38.360
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:44.600
<i>A coin in my pocket,
and do you wanna be my friend?</i>

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:49.970
<i>We are, We are on the cruise!</i>

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:51.040
<i>We are!</i>

00:01:53.270 --> 00:01:55.210
Get back here!

00:01:55.210 --> 00:01:57.970
Give that chart back,
you damn woman thief!

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:10.660
W-what?!

00:02:10.660 --> 00:02:13.860
A person fell from the sky!

00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:15.850
Now I'm safe!

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:21.300
That was a pretty neat
experience I had!

00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:30.300
"A Terrifying, Mysterious Power!
Captain Buggy, the Clown Pirate!"

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:34.020
I'm starving...

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:37.120
B- Boss!
You came to save me!

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:38.920
Wha?

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:40.580
Who're you?

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:44.850
Sorry, but they're
all yours now!

00:02:47.460 --> 00:02:48.800
Hey! The girl got away!

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:51.470
That's okay!
Her boss is still here!

00:02:51.470 --> 00:02:55.470
Ah! Tryin' to cover
for your crony, huh?!

00:02:55.470 --> 00:02:58.170
Say, is there any place
to eat around here?

00:02:58.170 --> 00:03:00.510
Quit screwin' around, kid!

00:03:09.950 --> 00:03:11.990
Don't touch my treasure!

00:03:11.990 --> 00:03:13.990
--Bastard!
--Bastard!

00:03:13.990 --> 00:03:16.080
Wonder if they killed that guy...

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:19.530
Gum-Gum Pistol!

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:27.470
Wow!

00:03:27.470 --> 00:03:29.460
You're really strong!

00:03:32.340 --> 00:03:35.440
You beat people with
sabers barehanded!

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:38.610
Hey! You're that... who?

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:41.280
I'm a thief who steals
from pirates!

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:44.920
The name's Nami!
Hey, wanna team up with me?!

00:03:44.920 --> 00:03:48.260
No. I don't feel like
teaming up with you.

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:51.690
H-hold on!

00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:54.030
Wait, I said!

00:03:54.030 --> 00:03:57.770
Oh. I just remembered!

00:03:57.770 --> 00:04:00.030
I'm starving...

00:04:00.030 --> 00:04:02.500
Shall I treat you to some food?

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:03.740
Really?!

00:04:03.740 --> 00:04:05.400
Y-yeah...

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:10.310
They still haven't
caught the thief?!

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:17.890
T-they should be pursuing her
as we speak, Captain Buggy! Yes!

00:04:17.890 --> 00:04:24.330
How did the map get stolen so easily
in the first place?! Huh?!

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:29.330
Just when we're about to enter
the Grand Line and go on a rampage!

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:35.000
A-actually, the shack was unlocked,
so it was easy to take for foes...

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:36.340
What did you say?!

00:04:36.340 --> 00:04:38.740
As I said, it was easy
to take for foes...

00:04:38.740 --> 00:04:42.010
<i>Who has a fake nose?!</i>

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:47.680
Do you find this nose funny?!
Just like a fake nose?!

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:49.580
You have it all wrong!

00:04:49.580 --> 00:04:52.680
It's huge and all red?!

00:04:54.290 --> 00:04:55.620
Help!

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:05.690
--H-here it comes...
--T-the Devil Fruit power...

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:14.640
Who am I?

00:05:14.640 --> 00:05:17.310
C- Captain Buggy...

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:24.550
What happens if someone
defies me?

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:27.560
A flashy death awaits them...

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:29.990
Please forgive me!

00:05:29.990 --> 00:05:32.660
I'll never say it again!

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:35.100
Please forgive me!

00:05:37.260 --> 00:05:43.070
I'll overlook your verbal slip-up
and forgive you just this once.

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:47.210
Now get that map back! Screw up...
and you know what happens.

00:05:47.210 --> 00:05:49.680
Yes, Captain Buggy!

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:56.320
Yum!

00:05:56.320 --> 00:05:59.020
Do you live alone in this house?

00:05:59.020 --> 00:06:02.120
I don't live in this town.

00:06:02.120 --> 00:06:05.690
Everyone here ran away
because of Buggy.

00:06:05.690 --> 00:06:08.160
--Then you're a sneak thief.
--How rude!

00:06:08.160 --> 00:06:11.370
I'm a thief who only
steals from pirates!

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:14.940
Don't compare me
to scumbag sneak thieves!

00:06:14.940 --> 00:06:18.240
But a thief's a thief.

00:06:18.240 --> 00:06:24.210
My goal is to earn 100 million Berries,
no matter what it takes.

00:06:24.210 --> 00:06:26.580
What do you need that much for?

00:06:26.580 --> 00:06:28.320
It's a secret!

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:34.090
But with a map of the Grand Line,
100 million is a real possibility!

00:06:34.090 --> 00:06:37.420
A map? Are you a navigator?!

00:06:37.420 --> 00:06:41.300
Much more skilled than
your average navigator!

00:06:41.300 --> 00:06:46.430
Oh, that's perfect!
Do you wanna be our navigator?!

00:06:46.430 --> 00:06:47.330
Really?

00:06:47.330 --> 00:06:50.440
Yeah! Our new pirate crew member!

00:06:50.440 --> 00:06:53.610
No!

00:06:53.610 --> 00:06:55.580
So you're a pirate?

00:06:55.580 --> 00:06:59.850
Yeah. I swore to the person
who gave me this straw hat...

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:03.180
...that I'd gather a crew
and become a pirate!

00:07:03.180 --> 00:07:06.050
There's nothing I hate more
in this world than pirates!

00:07:06.050 --> 00:07:08.290
I only like money and tangerines!

00:07:08.290 --> 00:07:10.390
Hey. Be our navigator.

00:07:10.390 --> 00:07:12.960
I said no.

00:07:12.960 --> 00:07:14.290
No?

00:07:16.100 --> 00:07:19.600
--Hey! You find her?!
--Can't find her anywhere!

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:21.400
Where'd that girl thief go?!

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:24.940
We're in trouble if
we don't get that chart back!

00:07:24.940 --> 00:07:29.110
<i>I gotta do something about them...</i>

00:07:29.110 --> 00:07:33.210
Well, I might consider it
if you agree to certain conditions!

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:35.650
Really?! I'll do anything!

00:07:35.650 --> 00:07:39.550
I want you to come with me
to see Buggy the pirate.

00:07:39.550 --> 00:07:41.220
But!

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:45.890
Why am I tied up?

00:07:45.890 --> 00:07:48.560
It's just rope.
Is there a problem?

00:07:48.560 --> 00:07:53.030
Oh well! I was hoping to meet
other pirates! Let's go!

00:07:53.030 --> 00:07:55.170
Hold on, now!

00:07:55.170 --> 00:07:58.070
What?!

00:07:58.070 --> 00:08:01.710
The thief got away?!

00:08:01.710 --> 00:08:03.810
Please forgive us, Captain!

00:08:03.810 --> 00:08:09.520
All three of you are pathetic!
Die flashily!

00:08:09.520 --> 00:08:11.620
Captain Buggy!

00:08:11.620 --> 00:08:12.620
What is it?!

00:08:12.620 --> 00:08:15.690
That thief from earlier
came back on her own!

00:08:15.690 --> 00:08:17.020
What?!

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:22.530
That's them!

00:08:22.530 --> 00:08:25.230
She's the one
who stole the chart!

00:08:30.300 --> 00:08:33.810
I've captured the thief,
Captain Buggy the Clown!

00:08:33.810 --> 00:08:35.280
Here's your chart back!

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:37.810
I appreciate it.

00:08:37.810 --> 00:08:40.540
But why the change of heart?

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:46.850
My boss and I had a fight!
I'm fed up with him!

00:08:46.850 --> 00:08:49.410
Please let me join your crew!

00:08:50.620 --> 00:08:53.260
C- Captain Buggy is angry!

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:55.630
He's gonna use his
Devil Fruit power!

00:08:55.630 --> 00:08:56.960
Devil?

00:09:02.700 --> 00:09:04.270
Fed up, huh?

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:05.940
You're a flashily
amusing girl!

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:08.930
I like you!
You can join my crew!

00:09:12.880 --> 00:09:14.550
<i>Infiltration successful!</i>

00:09:14.550 --> 00:09:17.450
<i>Pirates are so dumb
and easy to manipulate!</i>

00:09:20.290 --> 00:09:22.280
Why am I in a cage?

00:09:24.890 --> 00:09:27.130
I feel great today!

00:09:27.130 --> 00:09:29.100
Girl! What name do you go by?

00:09:29.100 --> 00:09:30.200
Nami!

00:09:30.200 --> 00:09:34.200
Alright! Let's hold a welcome
party for Nami here!

00:09:34.200 --> 00:09:35.690
Celebrate flashily!

00:09:53.390 --> 00:09:56.160
What's wrong?!
This party's in your honor!

00:09:56.160 --> 00:09:58.590
Eat up!

00:09:58.590 --> 00:10:01.260
Yes! Thank you!

00:10:01.260 --> 00:10:05.230
<i>I'll just keep my eyes peeled for
a chance to take the chart back.</i>

00:10:05.230 --> 00:10:09.000
<i>And maybe I'll swipe all of Buggy's
treasure too, while I'm at it!</i>

00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:20.170
I... wanna eat, too!

00:10:23.420 --> 00:10:24.750
Dammit!

00:10:33.190 --> 00:10:35.930
This is flashily great!

00:10:35.930 --> 00:10:41.060
Men! Prepare
a Special Buggy Ball!

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:05.730
All set, sir!

00:11:05.730 --> 00:11:08.200
W-what's about to happen?

00:11:08.200 --> 00:11:11.230
Observe the might
of the Buggy Ball!

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:12.560
Light it.

00:11:40.290 --> 00:11:42.360
What's that explosion?

00:11:42.360 --> 00:11:46.200
<i>One of Buggy-sama's
beloved Buggy Balls!</i>

00:11:46.200 --> 00:11:47.690
Buggy Balls?!

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:09.660
Truly flashy!

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:11.660
With Buggy Balls
and Devil Fruit powers,

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:14.860
I can conquer the Grand Line!

00:12:14.860 --> 00:12:16.100
Right, Nami?!

00:12:16.100 --> 00:12:17.900
Y-yes! Of course!

00:12:17.900 --> 00:12:20.430
Eh?!

00:12:20.430 --> 00:12:24.040
<i>I'm the one who's gonna
rule the Grand Line!</i>

00:12:24.040 --> 00:12:25.210
What?

00:12:25.210 --> 00:12:27.710
<i>I'm gonna be
King of the Pirates!</i>

00:12:27.710 --> 00:12:29.400
You idiot!

00:12:32.650 --> 00:12:34.980
I see why you're sick
of him, Nami!

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:38.190
Yeah! He takes
the world too lightly...

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:39.850
...and misunderstands
everything!

00:12:39.850 --> 00:12:42.390
I couldn't put up
with it anymore...

00:12:42.390 --> 00:12:43.390
Naturally!

00:12:43.390 --> 00:12:48.560
In that case, I'll give you a Buggy
Ball to blow away your old boss!

00:12:49.930 --> 00:12:55.700
It'll also serve to prove
your loyalty to me. Do it!

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:05.050
No, that's okay!

00:13:05.050 --> 00:13:09.310
C'mon, this is a welcoming party!
Let's have fun!

00:13:10.520 --> 00:13:14.510
Do it. This is my style
of welcoming party.

00:13:16.820 --> 00:13:26.820
Fire! Fire! Fire! Fire!

00:13:28.600 --> 00:13:32.510
<i>If I don't shoot,
I'll be killed!</i>

00:13:32.510 --> 00:13:38.000
<i>But if I do shoot, I'll wind
up no better than pirates!</i>

00:13:52.630 --> 00:13:55.360
Alright! Light it flashily!

00:13:55.360 --> 00:14:05.360
Fire! Fire! Fire! Fire!

00:14:07.510 --> 00:14:10.840
Nami! Don't wimp out on me now!

00:14:13.050 --> 00:14:14.510
What's the matter?

00:14:14.510 --> 00:14:16.180
Your hands are shaking!

00:14:17.550 --> 00:14:22.720
That's what happens when you take
on pirates with half-assed resolve.

00:14:22.720 --> 00:14:24.160
Resolve to do what?!

00:14:24.160 --> 00:14:26.390
To kill people like
it's nothing?!

00:14:26.390 --> 00:14:28.130
Is that a pirate's resolve?!

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:29.460
No!

00:14:32.230 --> 00:14:34.740
The resolve to put your
own life on the line!

00:14:34.740 --> 00:14:41.340
Fire! Fire! Fire! Fire!

00:14:41.340 --> 00:14:44.010
Hey, new chick!
Quit bein' a tease!

00:14:44.010 --> 00:14:46.170
This is how you light it!

00:15:04.730 --> 00:15:08.240
What the-?! What the-?!

00:15:08.240 --> 00:15:11.040
Crap! I didn't mean to-

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:14.510
Nami! What is the meaning
of this?!

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:15.540
I'm sorry!

00:15:15.540 --> 00:15:18.650
What?! Apologizing
won't fix things!

00:15:18.650 --> 00:15:22.080
<i>Huh? Now you're saving me?</i>

00:15:22.080 --> 00:15:23.650
Don't be stupid!

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:26.150
I only did it because
of the situation!

00:15:26.150 --> 00:15:29.620
I just didn't want to wind up
like these inhuman pirates!

00:15:29.620 --> 00:15:31.590
Oh, the situation!

00:15:31.590 --> 00:15:34.130
Pirates took the life
of a person dear to me!

00:15:34.130 --> 00:15:35.860
As if I'd ever be one!

00:15:35.860 --> 00:15:38.730
Oh, so that's why... Huh?

00:15:39.970 --> 00:15:42.570
It's lit!

00:15:42.570 --> 00:15:45.970
Keep your ridicule
to a minimum, girl!

00:15:45.970 --> 00:15:47.610
Kill her flashily!

00:15:47.610 --> 00:15:49.270
Yahoo!

00:15:58.520 --> 00:15:59.850
Water! Water! Water! Water!

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:06.520
Not good!

00:16:13.370 --> 00:16:14.700
You're...

00:16:26.480 --> 00:16:27.480
Behind you!

00:16:27.480 --> 00:16:29.470
Die flashily!

00:16:40.730 --> 00:16:43.200
Hey, now...

00:16:43.200 --> 00:16:46.660
How many of you are taking
on one girl at once?

00:16:47.970 --> 00:16:49.630
Zoro!

00:16:55.040 --> 00:16:56.700
You hurt?

00:16:57.780 --> 00:16:59.610
Are you hurt?

00:16:59.610 --> 00:17:02.350
N-no, I'm fine...

00:17:02.350 --> 00:17:04.380
Whew, what a relief!

00:17:04.380 --> 00:17:07.950
How'd you find us?
Hurry and get me outta here!

00:17:07.950 --> 00:17:10.820
What do you keep
playing around for?

00:17:10.820 --> 00:17:13.890
First some bird runs off with you,
and now you're inside a cage?

00:17:13.890 --> 00:17:16.200
It's pretty interesting, actually.

00:17:16.200 --> 00:17:17.900
"Zoro"?

00:17:17.900 --> 00:17:21.070
T-that's what he just
called him, right?

00:17:21.070 --> 00:17:26.310
<i>The crew member he mentioned...
was Pirate Hunter Zoro?</i>

00:17:26.310 --> 00:17:28.610
<i>What's going on?!</i>

00:17:29.280 --> 00:17:31.710
So you're Zoro?

00:17:31.710 --> 00:17:35.780
What do you want? Are you here
to take my head or something?

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:41.890
Nope. Not interested.
I gave up pirate-hunting.

00:17:41.890 --> 00:17:46.730
<i>I'm interested, though!
Killing you will increase my name.</i>

00:17:46.730 --> 00:17:49.160
I wouldn't try it. You'll die.

00:17:49.160 --> 00:17:51.720
Oh? That so?

00:17:54.070 --> 00:17:57.640
Guess words aren't
enough for you...

00:17:57.640 --> 00:18:02.010
--Get 'im, Captain!
--Captain Buggy!

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:12.010
Buggy! Buggy! Buggy!

00:18:25.070 --> 00:18:28.300
Die flashily!

00:18:47.120 --> 00:18:49.590
He had no resistance
to him at all...

00:18:49.590 --> 00:18:53.230
Whoa! He's weak!

00:18:53.230 --> 00:18:54.560
No way...

00:19:04.570 --> 00:19:06.170
What's with them?

00:19:06.170 --> 00:19:09.740
H-huh? Their captain's
been killed...

00:19:09.740 --> 00:19:10.840
But they're laughing!

00:19:10.840 --> 00:19:14.340
Hey! What's so damn funny?!

00:19:22.460 --> 00:19:23.920
Zoro!

00:19:25.060 --> 00:19:26.430
What's that arm?!

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:28.760
What... the hell?!

00:19:32.470 --> 00:19:35.400
The Chop-Chop Fruit...

00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:38.960
That's the name of
the Devil Fruit I ate!

00:19:40.310 --> 00:19:44.470
I'm a chop-chop person
who can't be cut!

00:19:47.550 --> 00:19:49.650
His body reattached itself!

00:19:49.650 --> 00:19:53.220
I thought the Devil Fruits
were only a rumor!

00:19:53.220 --> 00:19:56.320
A chop-chop guy?!
You mean he's a monster?!

00:19:56.320 --> 00:19:58.550
"Rubber Person"

00:19:59.660 --> 00:20:01.660
I didn't hit any vital spots,

00:20:01.660 --> 00:20:04.160
but that's a pretty
serious wound! I win!

00:20:04.160 --> 00:20:06.500
You're too much, Captain!

00:20:06.500 --> 00:20:10.900
Buggy! Buggy! Buggy!

00:20:10.900 --> 00:20:14.510
<i>Crap! The tables have turned!</i>

00:20:14.510 --> 00:20:18.340
<i>If we don't do something quick,
me and these two guys are dead!</i>

00:20:19.750 --> 00:20:22.620
That one hurt a bit...

00:20:22.620 --> 00:20:31.520
Buggy! Buggy! Buggy!

00:20:31.520 --> 00:20:34.030
Stabbing him from behind
is unfair,

00:20:34.030 --> 00:20:36.360
Big Nose!

00:20:39.730 --> 00:20:43.400
<i>Y-you idiot!
Don't call him that!</i>

00:20:46.440 --> 00:20:51.940
<i>Who's... got a big nose?!</i>

00:20:53.110 --> 00:20:55.680
Luffy!

00:20:55.680 --> 00:20:58.320
Buggy!

00:20:58.320 --> 00:21:01.550
<i>I will kick your ass!</i>

00:21:05.590 --> 00:21:08.930
<i>Kick my ass?
You're a real riot!</i>

00:21:08.930 --> 00:21:12.430
All three of you are gonna die here,
you know!

00:21:12.430 --> 00:21:17.600
How should I have my ass
kicked in this situation?!

00:21:21.910 --> 00:21:24.400
It's no use...
It's all over...

00:21:27.410 --> 00:21:29.920
I refuse to die!

00:21:29.920 --> 00:21:31.380
Run! Zoro!

00:21:31.380 --> 00:21:32.420
What?!

00:21:32.420 --> 00:21:35.520
Wait! He came here
to save you!

00:21:35.520 --> 00:21:37.250
<i>What're you gonna do?!</i>

00:21:43.060 --> 00:21:44.130
Understood.

00:21:44.130 --> 00:21:49.100
<i>Nothing makes sense anymore!
This is why I hate pirates!</i>

00:21:49.100 --> 00:21:53.770
Impudent fool!
As if I'd let you escape!

00:22:00.010 --> 00:22:05.220
Fool! Your Three-Sword Style
has no effect on-

00:22:05.220 --> 00:22:07.710
Hey! Listen when
people are talking!

00:22:24.570 --> 00:22:27.940
Oh, crap!
The cannon's pointed this way!

00:22:27.940 --> 00:22:29.940
--Hey! Light it!
--Eh?!

00:22:29.940 --> 00:22:32.580
--Hurry!
--R-right!

00:22:32.580 --> 00:22:38.020
Wait, wait, wait! There's still
a Special Buggy Ball in there!

00:22:40.990 --> 00:22:43.120
You lit it!

00:22:43.120 --> 00:22:47.720
Wait! No! Stop! Stop!

00:22:56.040 --> 00:23:06.030
<i>When I was little, I had
a vision of a treasure map</i>

00:23:10.280 --> 00:23:17.220
<i>and I always searched
for that miraculous place</i>

00:23:17.220 --> 00:23:24.390
<i>before someone else could
beat me to it</i>

00:23:26.930 --> 00:23:36.930
<i>If the world is going to change</i>

00:23:38.410 --> 00:23:45.420
<i>before I can even attain my dream</i>

00:23:45.420 --> 00:23:52.490
<i>then take me to the time
when I knew nothing</i>

00:23:52.490 --> 00:24:02.490
<i>so that my memories won't fade</i>
